  "verseCount": 42,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "David and Jonathan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then David fled from Naioth at Ramah and went to Jonathan and asked, \"What have I done? What is my crime? How have I wronged your father, that he is trying to kill me?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Never!\" Jonathan replied. \"You are not going to die! Look, my father doesn't do anything, great or small, without letting me know. Why would he hide this from me? It isn't so!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But David took an oath and said, \"Your father knows very well that I have found favor in your eyes, and he has said to himself, 'Jonathan must not know this or he will be grieved.' Yet as surely as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lives and as you live, there is only a step between me and death.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonathan said to David, \"Whatever you want me to do, I'll do for you.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So David said, \"Look, tomorrow is the New Moon feast, and I am supposed to dine with the king; but let me go and hide in the field until the evening of the day after tomorrow.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If your father misses me at all, tell him, 'David earnestly asked my permission to hurry to Bethlehem, his hometown, because an annual sacrifice is being made there for his whole clan.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If he says, 'Very well,' then your servant is safe. But if he loses his temper, you can be sure that he is determined to harm me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As for you, show kindness to your servant, for you have brought him into a covenant with you before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". If I am guilty, then kill me yourself! Why hand me over to your father?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Never!\" Jonathan said. \"If I had the least inkling that my father was determined to harm you, wouldn't I tell you?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David asked, \"Who will tell me if your father answers you harshly?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Come,\" Jonathan said, \"let's go out into the field.\" So they went there together.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jonathan said to David, \"I swear by the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, that I will surely sound out my father by this time the day after tomorrow! If he is favorably disposed toward you, will I not send you word and let you know?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if my father intends to harm you, may the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "deal with Jonathan, be it ever so severely, if I do not let you know and send you away in peace. May the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "be with you as he has been with my father.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But show me unfailing kindness like the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'s kindness as long as I live, so that I may not be killed,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and do not ever cut off your kindness from my family—not even when the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has cut off every one of David's enemies from the face of the earth.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Jonathan made a covenant with the house of David, saying, \"May the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "call David's enemies to account.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jonathan had David reaffirm his oath out of love for him, because he loved him as he loved himself.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jonathan said to David, \"Tomorrow is the New Moon feast. You will be missed, because your seat will be empty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The day after tomorrow, toward evening, go to the place where you hid when this trouble began, and wait by the stone Ezel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will shoot three arrows to the side of it, as though I were shooting at a target.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I will send a boy and say, 'Go, find the arrows.' If I say to him, 'Look, the arrows are on this side of you; bring them here,' then come, because, as surely as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lives, you are safe; there is no danger.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if I say to the boy, 'Look, the arrows are beyond you,' then you must go, because the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has sent you away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And about the matter you and I discussed—remember, the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is witness between you and me forever.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So David hid in the field, and when the New Moon feast came, the king sat down to eat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He sat in his customary place by the wall, opposite Jonathan,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "and Abner sat next to Saul, but David's place was empty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saul said nothing that day, for he thought, \"Something must have happened to David to make him ceremonially unclean—surely he is unclean.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the next day, the second day of the month, David's place was empty again. Then Saul said to his son Jonathan, \"Why hasn't the son of Jesse come to the meal, either yesterday or today?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonathan answered, \"David earnestly asked me for permission to go to Bethlehem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said, 'Let me go, because our family is observing a sacrifice in the town and my brother has ordered me to be there. If I have found favor in your eyes, let me get away to see my brothers.' That is why he has not come to the king's table.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saul's anger flared up at Jonathan and he said to him, \"You son of a perverse and rebellious woman! Don't I know that you have sided with the son of Jesse to your own shame and to the shame of the mother who bore you?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As long as the son of Jesse lives on this earth, neither you nor your kingdom will be established. Now send someone to bring him to me, for he must die!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Why should he be put to death? What has he done?\" Jonathan asked his father.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Saul hurled his spear at him to kill him. Then Jonathan knew that his father intended to kill David.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonathan got up from the table in fierce anger; on that second day of the feast he did not eat, because he was grieved at his father's shameful treatment of David.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the morning Jonathan went out to the field for his meeting with David. He had a small boy with him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he said to the boy, \"Run and find the arrows I shoot.\" As the boy ran, he shot an arrow beyond him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the boy came to the place where Jonathan's arrow had fallen, Jonathan called out after him, \"Isn't the arrow beyond you?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he shouted, \"Hurry! Go quickly! Don't stop!\" The boy picked up the arrow and returned to his master.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(The boy knew nothing about all this; only Jonathan and David knew.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jonathan gave his weapons to the boy and said, \"Go, carry them back to town.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After the boy had gone, David got up from the south side of the stone and bowed down before Jonathan three times, with his face to the ground. Then they kissed each other and wept together—but David wept the most.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonathan said to David, \"Go in peace, for we have sworn friendship with each other in the name of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.42",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.21.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", saying, 'The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.42",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.21.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is witness between you and me, and between your descendants and my descendants forever.' \" Then David left, and Jonathan went back to the town.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "1SA.21",
    "number": "21",
    "bookId": "1SA"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "1SA.19",
    "number": "19",
    "bookId": "1SA"
  }
}